},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499515307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112432#issuecomment-3499515307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112432","id":3499515307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Qll2r","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T21:47:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T21:47:36Z","body":"I put together a very simple MRP:\n[mat-ppreview-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23402831/mat-ppreview-error.zip)\n\nThis is fairly difficult to reproduce reliably, but the most consistent way is to:\n- Open the project and `node_3d.tscn`,\n- Select the mesh instances,\n- Look at the `Material Override` property in the inspector.\n- If everything appears to be correct, try changing the material's parameters and save the scene. Then, select another mesh instance.\n\nThe bug causes the material to use an incorrect preview thumbnail, like so:\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"578\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b5466f6-d9c5-4145-b637-6e5b5976a46d\" />\n\nIn some other cases, the thumbnail may be invisible, or use the default white material.\n\nFrom my own testing, this bug seems to happen when a preview generator is using the `request_and_wait` method, which waits for the rendering thread. As a result, this bug affects the mesh previews as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499515307/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3501670182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112432#issuecomment-3501670182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112432","id":3501670182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Qtz8m","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T10:14:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T17:44:45Z","body":"#112060 seemingly fixes this, as it reworks the way threading works during thumbnail generation. @miruji could you check whether that fixes the issue?\n\nEdit: That PR fixes the bug in a hacky way that calls the `request_and_wait` function twice. It would probably be better to make a dedicated fix for it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3501670182/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3501996402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112432#issuecomment-3501996402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112432","id":3501996402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QvDly","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T11:25:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T11:25:56Z","body":"> [#112060](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112060) seemingly fixes this, as it reworks the way threading works during thumbnail generation. [@miruji](https://github.com/miruji) could you check whether that fixes the issue?\n\nI’m not testing this myself because I’m just reporting the issues — maybe someone else can check it and share the results here. However, if it gets fixed in a newer version, I’ll report it, or I’ll add another version where the bug is still present.\n\nI also see that the issue you mentioned, **#112060**, is related not only to this one but also to the main one, **#109332**. As I mentioned earlier, all rendering bugs behave quite similarly. Therefore, I think if this fix resolves the problem, it might address several issues at once.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3501996402/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]